WEBVTT

NOTE Video ID: TaxOZB8JZC4

NOTE Language: en

00:00:05.299 --> 00:00:11.443
Today I find all of you here as the lights sitting before Me.

00:00:11.543 --> 00:00:17.584
And with these lights I feel
the Deepawali really celebrated,

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:22.779
I see the twingling of those eyes,
twinkling in the eye

00:00:22.879 --> 00:00:26.727
of that light which is within you.

00:00:26.827 --> 00:00:35.486
In the lamp of light we have to put
something that is soft, like ghee,

00:00:35.586 --> 00:00:43.378
that’s something very mild and soft,
is the love of our heart.

00:00:43.478 --> 00:00:51.521
And that burns to give this soothing
light of love to others.

00:00:51.621 --> 00:00:57.015
Such a person who has this light
of love, loves himself as well,

00:00:57.115 --> 00:01:01.511
and emits love for others.

00:01:01.611 --> 00:01:07.580
I’ve been hearing about the way people
used to torture themselves

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:09.787
to become saintly.

00:01:09.887 --> 00:01:15.347
There’s no need at all for sahaja yogis
- at all - to torture themselves.

00:01:15.447 --> 00:01:23.245
But to be the light of a higher
magnitude,

00:01:23.345 --> 00:01:28.440
they have to be full of love.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:33.595
And this love they get it
from where?

00:01:33.695 --> 00:01:36.150
You may say it is from Me,

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:42.174
is true, but the sap of the tree
flows all over,

00:01:42.274 --> 00:01:45.465
and all the tree must live
together.

00:01:45.565 --> 00:01:49.794
Any leaf that wants to separate itself
will die out.

00:01:49.894 --> 00:01:54.162
So is the collectivity which is going
to make you grow.

00:01:54.262 --> 00:02:00.460
Any ideas which you have of keeping
yourself out,

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:08.560
or preserving yourself out, or having
your houses separate

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:12.190
from the collectivity, may be
dangerous.

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:18.955
The houses may be separate, but they
must be the houses of all the sahaja yogis.

00:02:19.055 --> 00:02:23.561
Anybody who comes to your house,
who is a sahaja yogi,

00:02:23.661 --> 00:02:28.234
is owner of that house.

00:02:28.334 --> 00:02:31.784
That sort of a feeling should be
developed,

00:02:31.884 --> 00:02:37.267
when the light you take out from
one room to another room,

00:02:37.367 --> 00:02:40.724
it does not say: “This is my room
so I give light,

00:02:40.824 --> 00:02:44.208
if I go to another room 
I will not give light.”

00:02:44.308 --> 00:02:48.353
Now, light is absolutely detached.

00:02:48.453 --> 00:02:53.689
If you do not look after your light,
it will extinguish.

00:02:53.789 --> 00:02:58.705
You have to look after it till it takes
its proper stand.

00:02:58.805 --> 00:03:01.613
And once it takes a particular
stand,

00:03:01.713 --> 00:03:06.811
then you are a strong sahaja
yogi.

00:03:06.911 --> 00:03:09.775
Then they see the light
on your face.

00:03:09.875 --> 00:03:13.383
And then you manifest light
in their lives.

00:03:13.483 --> 00:03:17.291
This light, if you put finger on it,
it will burn.

00:03:17.391 --> 00:03:20.968
But the light of love never
burns.

00:03:21.068 --> 00:03:24.153
It dissolves all that is bad.

00:03:24.253 --> 00:03:28.895
It rejects, it turns away from whatever
that is wrong.

00:03:28.995 --> 00:03:31.482
It has patience

00:03:31.582 --> 00:03:36.511
and it expels the darkness.

00:03:36.611 --> 00:03:39.410
Darkness within and without.

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:43.604
In this Diwali day, let us wish

00:03:43.704 --> 00:03:49.747
that so many people fall into
this ocean of joy,

00:03:49.847 --> 00:03:57.801
and the ocean of joy has to expand
its borders.

00:03:57.901 --> 00:04:00.952
A sea never does that,

00:04:01.052 --> 00:04:07.738
but sahaja yogis can do it because
they have ocean of love in their hearts.

00:04:07.838 --> 00:04:13.371
So I wish you all a very happy Diwali,
in the sense

00:04:13.471 --> 00:04:18.101
that you will enlighten more lights,
every sahaja yogi

00:04:18.201 --> 00:04:22.743
should enlighten at least hundred
lights in this year.

00:04:22.843 --> 00:04:28.498
Every person you meet, you can talk
to them about Sahaja Yoga.

00:04:28.598 --> 00:04:32.648
Not about Me. Later on,
gradually.

00:04:32.748 --> 00:04:38.068
So I hope you’ll enjoy your Diwali here,
all of you,

00:04:38.168 --> 00:04:44.207
and we’ll create an ocean which
will expand, grow,

00:04:44.307 --> 00:04:49.860
and engulf more and more people
into this joyous company.

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:53.661
So, all these things should be attended too and you must see to it

00:04:53.761 --> 00:04:58.129
that you keep your personality alright, your nationality alright,

00:04:58.229 --> 00:05:00.522
your clothes alright, everything alright. But,

00:05:00.622 --> 00:05:05.478
your personality must merge with the collective otherwise there will be a big problem.

00:05:05.578 --> 00:05:09.358
And I respect all the people who keep their personality,

00:05:09.458 --> 00:05:13.474
keep their nationality, keep the way they are.

00:05:13.574 --> 00:05:18.049
Actually these days the situation is such that fashion starts

00:05:18.149 --> 00:05:23.197
so people start cutting their hair, fashion starts, they start making their hair funny.

00:05:23.297 --> 00:05:27.652
So, in the fashion you cannot even make out which personality one person is.

00:05:27.752 --> 00:05:33.866
It is better to dress up in you own personality, in your own country way, the way you are.

00:05:33.966 --> 00:05:44.527
And it is very beautiful to see diversity in that way creating a beautiful unity among us.

00:05:44.627 --> 00:05:47.950
The personality, as it is, keep it. It’s nice.

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:51.916
I am happy he has shown you there are certain personalities and all that,

00:05:52.016 --> 00:05:58.093
and when you see them you enjoy them and
everybody is enjoying their laughing at themselves.

00:05:58.193 --> 00:06:01.888
It is a very big thing that you can laugh at yourself and appreciate it.

00:06:01.988 --> 00:06:04.448
It is a sign of real wisdom.

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:16.308
On a Diwali day we have to understand that we
are all lights on the path the ascent of many people.

00:06:16.408 --> 00:06:23.972
We all should keep our light afloat, enjoyable, laughing at ourselves,

00:06:24.072 --> 00:06:28.864
making fun of each other, sometimes pulling legs is alright,

00:06:28.964 --> 00:06:34.650
but in no way, in no way it should be hurting another personality,

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:38.308
means to say something on the physical side of it.

00:06:38.408 --> 00:06:43.276
Specially one should not remark like somebody is a lame person or a blind person,

00:06:43.376 --> 00:06:45.373
you should never make fun of such a thing.

00:06:45.473 --> 00:06:53.291
Otherwise the [UNCLEAR] and behaviour is very
important to see and will be very much appreciated.

00:06:53.391 --> 00:06:59.403
Actually I had never known so many foreigners – as I call them – they are now My children.

00:06:59.503 --> 00:07:04.450
And when I go to different countries I see
different-different styles and different-different ways

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:08.737
of their food, their – every habit is different.

00:07:08.837 --> 00:07:14.892
I really enjoy the way people eat differently and talk differently.

00:07:14.992 --> 00:07:19.685
It’s very nice, but in all that one has to see the beauty:

00:07:19.785 --> 00:07:26.214
how God has created so many human beings, so many faces,

00:07:27.301 --> 00:07:32.977
by little-little small little cells how he has changed the faces of people.

00:07:33.077 --> 00:07:36.611
Then every country has a different type of a face.

00:07:36.711 --> 00:07:43.310
Then every – even a part of the country may have a different type of a face.

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:47.419
So, all this is done just to create beauty and love,

00:07:47.519 --> 00:07:55.571
to show that even if we are all outside different inside we are one.

00:07:55.671 --> 00:08:01.509
Animals are – all of them are – I mean there is not much of a difference.

00:08:01.609 --> 00:08:06.767
Unless and until you are very particular you
cannot find out one animal from another animal.

00:08:06.867 --> 00:08:10.237
If they live with human beings of course it is different, but otherwise

00:08:10.337 --> 00:08:14.517
if you go in the jungle you cannot make out one tiger, one to another.

00:08:14.617 --> 00:08:17.429
It is all just the same, they look the same.

00:08:17.529 --> 00:08:20.036
But this differentiation has come in human beings.

00:08:20.136 --> 00:08:24.538
And in Sahaja Yoga when you grow more the outside differences

00:08:24.638 --> 00:08:27.994
could be even more interesting, could be much more interesting.

00:08:28.094 --> 00:08:34.189
But the one sign I know about Sahaja Yogis is that their faces glow.

00:08:34.289 --> 00:08:41.498
Faces glow, eyes have a beautiful twinkling in
the eyes and they are all, all the time enjoying.

00:08:41.598 --> 00:08:45.770
That is what it is we have to celebrate 
our own joy, our own virtue,

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:48.739
our own righteousness and all our styles.

00:08:48.839 --> 00:08:50.911
May God bless you.